{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7HKR9WsCBVZmXvMMHUL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I left out your age because it doesn't belong in a cover letter. I kept the caregiving gap short and direct.\n\n<final_document>\nDear [Hiring Manager's Name],\n\nI am writing to apply for the Office Manager position at [Practice Name]. For eleven years I was office manager at [Clinic Name], a veterinary clinic with four veterinarians and fourteen staff. I would welcome the chance to bring that experience to a practice here in [Town].\n\nAt the clinic I handled scheduling and billing for a busy practice with several providers. In 2014 I led our move from paper records to practice management software, and I kept daily operations running while the staff adjusted to the new system. In my last three years there, I reduced invoices more than 90 days past due from about $38,000 to $9,000.\n\nFor the past seven years I stepped away from work to care for my mother full-time. I managed her insurance claims and coordinated her appointments with six specialists. That gave me a close view of medical billing and scheduling from the patient's side, and it showed me how much a well-run front office matters to the people it serves. My mother passed away this spring, and I am ready to return to the work I know.\n\nI understand your practice uses Dentrix. My experience is with AVImark, but I have taken an entire office from paper to software once already, and I am confident I can learn Dentrix quickly.\n\nI would be glad to talk about how I can support your dentists and your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]\n[Phone] | [Email]\n</final_document>\n\nThe letter is about 265 words. Some things to check before you send it:\n\n- **Supervising staff:** You didn't say whether you directly supervised the 14 staff at the clinic. If you did, add a line such as \"I supervised a staff of fourteen\" to the second paragraph. The posting says this job manages 9 people, so that line would match it directly.\n- **Dentrix:** If you can start a Dentrix tutorial or online course before you apply, change the Dentrix sentence to \"I have already begun learning Dentrix.\" That's much stronger than a promise that you'll learn it.\n- **Overdue invoices:** If you remember how you reduced the overdue invoices (for example, new payment policies or regular follow-up calls), adding a few words about it would make that result stronger."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5373,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5373},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f53c9e7a-8c18-4d1e-9740-d9fd3f815c10","uuid":"ecdd823d-b4fc-4bcc-8b36-98e39ce702ed","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:02:11.061Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7HKQz6Jen5HAeQkqtjK"}
